 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{14185E001DCC7FE8}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "a. Enemy Forces:"\
     "Soviet motor rifle company located to our north. Expected They will dispatch a platoon to attack friendly position at Lacourt manor. Small arms include AK pattern rifles, PK machine guns, RPGs. APCs are BTR-70s."\
     ""\
     "b. Friendly Forces:"\
     "The platoon commander and 1/3rd of the platoon were killed/captured in the fight over Gravette. We have retreated to the Lacourt manor. We have got comms with 2 Coy however they are a couple of hours from reinforcing and relieving us. "\
     ""\
     "c. Terrain"\
     "Forests, hills, a lake. Look at the map, man."\
     ""\
     "d. Weather"\
     "Overcast."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{00358538C272B5D7}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "Defend our position at Lacourt manor until 2 Coy can relieve us."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{0E0E35481E078606}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "a. Enemy Forces:"\
     "Remnants of a British platoon have fallen back to Lacourt manor. "\
     "Their Plt CO and a squad was killed in the fight for Gravette. "\
     "We anticipate they will not retreat further and will hold out until reinforcements arrive. "\
     "They have L1A1 SLRs, L4 Bren Guns, L7 GPMGs for small arms, as well as Carl Gustav and M72 anti-tank weapons."\
     ""\
     "b. Friendly Forces:"\
     "2nd Plt 4 Coy (us) is located south of Gravette, at grid (039,073). "\
     "We have been tasked with attacking the British position at Lacourt manor. We have been reinforced with the PK section and given control of a mortar section."\
     "4 Coy HQ occupies Gravette and 3 Coy occupies Montingac but after heavy fighting is unable to assist us."\
     ""\
     "c. Terrain:"\
     "Forests, hills, a lake. Read the map, man."\
     ""\
     "d. Weather:"\
     "Overcast."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{D68518815B550196}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Command and Signal"
     m_sContent "a. Command"\
     "Chain of command is: Plt Sjt > 1st Section > 2nd Section"\
     ""\
     "b. Signal"\
     "Platoon Net - 46MHz"\
     "Platoon HQ - 32"\
     "1st Section - 32 Alpha"\
     "2nd Section - 32 Bravo"\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{5CEAC5B1676F7A8C}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "Attack the British position at Lacourt manor, destroying the remnants of the platoon holding it or drive them away from it."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{B07F564C7D4C9DD1}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "Sustainment"
     m_sContent "MG Ammo is crossloaded."\
     "No other resupply."\
     "(Unless the GMs spawn stuff)"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{06722DFD4B1769DC}" {
