    GC_Briefing "{C2381DAF1E5A44FA}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "Notes"
     m_sContent "Scenario:"\
     "The remnants of a British rifle platoon have fallen back to the Lacourt manor. A Soviet motor rifle platoon in BTRs has been tasked with eliminating the British remants and seizing the manor and immediate surrounding area."\
     ""\
     ""\
     "Notes:"\
     "- Ratio 2:1."\
     "- Setup 5 mins."\
     "- Objective end condition applies when USSR controls the cap zone with no British forces inside."\
     "- USSR loses if they take 90% casualties."\
     "- No time limit."\
     "- There are additional buildings and vegetation not marked on the map"\
     ""\
     ""
